# The build context is os/rootfs/packages-src/, the driver's own directory, and
# this producer needs NOTHING out of it. Its payload comes from the board
# directory, the shared overlay, the initramfs sources and os/pkgs/rauc, all of
# which arrive as named build contexts (see producer.env's BUILD_CONTEXTS), and
# the packer arrives as the `packer` context the driver passes itself.
#
# So the context is emptied rather than filtered: an edit to the driver, to the
# README or to any sibling producer that lands beside them cannot invalidate
# this producer's cache, and nothing can be COPYed from there by accident.
*
